# Purpose
# Validate screenshot artifacts and compare them with visual baselines.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root after browser verification.
# .\scripts\verify-visual-artifacts.ps1 -ArtifactDirectory verification-artifacts\manual-check
# .\scripts\verify-visual-artifacts.ps1 -ArtifactDirectory verification-artifacts\manual-check -UpdateMissingBaselines
# .\scripts\verify-visual-artifacts.ps1 -ArtifactDirectory verification-artifacts\manual-check -RequireBaselines
#
# Useful options
# -ArtifactDirectory chooses the screenshot folder to validate.
# -BaselineDirectory chooses the baseline folder.
# -PixelDifferenceThreshold sets per pixel tolerance.
# -SampleStride sets comparison sampling density.
# -UpdateBaselines refreshes all baselines.
# -UpdateMissingBaselines creates only missing baselines.
# -RequireBaselines fails when any baseline is missing.
#
# Recommended next command
# Review browser-verification.json and visual-validation.json in the artifact folder.
#
# Notes
# This script does not run the browser.
# It checks that screenshots are nonblank and visually varied.
